<title>LITHUANIA: KALNAPILIS SHARES TO RESUME TRADE ON TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>KALNAPILIS SHARES TO RESUME TRADE ON TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's stock exchange said on Monday that trade in shares of Kalnapilis brewery will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the beverage producer had completed the increase of its authorized share capital to almost 25.5 million litas from around 8.5 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
